{
  "source": "course-assets/your-choices/your-choices.mp4",
  "duration": 162.1333125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.6,
      "text": "Choosing a music app is simple, you pick Spotify, Apple Music, or something else, and then you just start listening."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.1,
      "end": 12.44,
      "text": "Using AI starts the same way, you pick an app."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.9,
      "end": 17.14,
      "text": "But depending on your subscription, you actually have up to four choices to make."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.72,
      "end": 24.3,
      "text": "You choose the app, the specific model, how much reasoning it uses, and whether it performs deeper research."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.3,
      "end": 27.44,
      "text": "You won't make all four choices every time."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 34.2,
      "text": "The default settings are a solid starting point for most jobs, but when the work gets harder or becomes more important,"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.58,
      "end": 38.88,
      "text": "knowing how to manipulate these four choices ensures you get the right result."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.32,
      "end": 45.18,
      "text": "Let's look at the first two configuration choices you encounter when setting up a task."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.9,
      "end": 47.44,
      "text": "Choice one is which app."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.04,
      "end": 49.62,
      "text": "Think of this as your home base."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.62,
      "end": 55.24,
      "text": "Choose the app that is available to you and naturally fits the tools and workflows you use the most."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.9,
      "end": 62.18,
      "text": "You should, however, divert to a second app when its specific strengths clearly fit the job at hand better than your home base."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.96,
      "end": 66.52,
      "text": "Once you have chosen your app, you arrive at choice two, which model."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.32,
      "end": 70.44,
      "text": "Many platforms offer a subset of options inside the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.0,
      "end": 75.64,
      "text": "Some apps offer a family of models, giving you a range of processing power to select from."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.64,
      "end": 82.7,
      "text": "Use the everyday model for your standard tasks, actively select a more capable model for difficult heavy lift work."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.26,
      "end": 88.36,
      "text": "Selecting the right combination prevents you from wasting slow, powerful computing on simple tasks"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.36,
      "end": 92.12,
      "text": "or failing at complex tasks by relying on two-week a model."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.42,
      "end": 99.78,
      "text": "Now we move to the deeper, optional processing configurations that dictate how the AI thinks and searches."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.78,
      "end": 101.86,
      "text": "Choice three is reasoning."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.5,
      "end": 106.82,
      "text": "Depending on the platform, apps might call this setting effort, thinking, or reasoning."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.64,
      "end": 114.1,
      "text": "You want to dial up this setting for math, code, planning, and any problem that requires distinct sequential steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.88,
      "end": 121.78,
      "text": "Keep this at the default setting for routine, straightforward work, which bypasses those deep logical steps for a faster response."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.72,
      "end": 123.82,
      "text": "And choice four is research."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.74,
      "end": 127.62,
      "text": "Some apps refer to this feature specifically as deep research."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.38,
      "end": 135.14,
      "text": "Mechanically, this function searches external data, compares various sources against each other, and returns a formally cited report."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.88,
      "end": 142.0,
      "text": "Use this tool for broad or highly current questions that strictly require synthesized information from many different sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.5,
      "end": 149.0,
      "text": "To recap, the four choices are the app, the model, how much reasoning to apply, and whether to run research."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.94,
      "end": 152.54,
      "text": "The choices behind the answer shape it."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.54,
      "end": 157.64,
      "text": "Use the default when it works. Change what you can when the work demands more."
    }
  ],
